<br/>
<br/>General priority is making sure you have 1742 Hit and Spirit combined and that you wear leather in every slot. The latter is because of a passive that increases our Intellect by 5% when we are only wearing leather. Beyond this you want to always make sure you use the highest possible item level in every slot, however we avoid PvP gear which is notably weaker in PvE. Trinkets are an exception to only looking at item level, check the trinket section for recommendations. <br/>
<br/>Understanding how stats affect Balance Druid is very helpful when gearing your Balance Druid, it is therefore recommended to have a look at the Balance Druid DPS Stat Priority and Attributes page.<br/>
