<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="learn-about-popular-gear-with-archon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Learn About Popular Gear With Archon</span></h3>As you gear up your character, you may not have the best gear available for every slot. <a href="https://www.archon.gg">
<img alt="" class="archon-logo-inline" src="https://assets.rpglogs.com/img/archon/logo-64.svg"/> Archon</a> compiles log data from thousands of players and shows <a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/balance/druid/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">the most popular builds and most popular alternatives</a>. At a glance, you can see what other players have done for different types of content.<br/>
<br/>
<a href="https://www.archon.gg/classic-cata/builds/balance/druid/raid/gear-and-tier-set/25-heroic/all-bosses" target="_blank">
