<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-balance-druid-dps">Head for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For every armor slot that can hold tier pieces, there are no other items from Dragon Soul in that slot. This leaves us with having no choice but running tier in every slot, including running Restoration tier in one slot. In addition, unless you have heroic tier 12, then running LFR tier pieces is always your best option.<br/>
<br/>There will be situations where one of your slots for holding tier items can instead be a non-tier item or an "offpiece" as it is commonly called. For Head, this would be if you have Balance tier in every slot except for Head and your best tier piece for Helm is from the LFR difficulty. In such situations <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77149/helmet-of-perpetual-rebirth">
<img alt="Helmet of Perpetual Rebirth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helmet of Perpetual Rebirth</span></a> is an upgrade. However it competes against much stronger <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> items, so it is not recommended to buy this before the recommended items earlier in the guide have been bought.<br/>
<br/>For Head we want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78696/deep-earth-cover">
<img alt="Deep Earth Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Cover</span></a>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
