<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-balance-druid-dps">Shoulders for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For every armor slot that can hold tier pieces, there are no other items from Dragon Soul in that slot. This leaves us with having no choice but running tier in every slot, including running Restoration tier in one slot. In addition, unless you have heroic tier 12, then running LFR tier pieces is always your best option.<br/>
<br/>There will be situations where one of your slots for holding tier items can instead be a non-tier item or an "offpiece" as it is commonly called. For Shoulder, this would be if you have Balance tier in every slot except for Shoulder and your best tier piece for Shoulder is from the LFR difficulty. In such situations <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71450/flickering-shoulderpads">
<img alt="Flickering Shoulderpads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flickering Shoulderpads</span></a> is an upgrade, preferred with the suffix "Undertow" which gives Haste and Spirit. <br/>
<br/>For Shoulders we want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78740/deep-earth-mantle">
<img alt="Deep Earth Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Mantle</span></a>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a> requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>
