<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-balance-druid-dps">Chest for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For every armor slot that can hold tier pieces, there are no other items from Dragon Soul in that slot. This leaves us with having no choice but running tier in every slot, including running Restoration tier in one slot. In addition, unless you have heroic tier 12, then running LFR tier pieces is always your best option.<br/>
<br/>There will be situations where one of your slots for holding tier items can instead be a non-tier item or an "offpiece" as it is commonly called. For Chest, this would be if you have Balance tier in every slot except for Chest and your best tier piece for Chest is from the LFR difficulty. In such situations <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77127/decaying-herbalists-robes">
<img alt="Decaying Herbalist's Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Decaying Herbalist's Robes</span></a> is an upgrade.<br/>
<br/>For Chest we want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78662/deep-earth-vestment">
<img alt="Deep Earth Vestment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Vestment</span></a>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
