<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-balance-druid-dps">Wrist for Balance Druid DPS</h4>We only have one Wrist item that drops in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>, which is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78372/mycosynth-wristguards">
<img alt="Mycosynth Wristguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mycosynth Wristguards</span></a>. The Heroic <span class="icon-heroic"></span> version is our Best in Slot. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71995/bracers-of-flowing-serenity">
<img alt="Bracers of Flowing Serenity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Flowing Serenity</span></a> are really strong, making them our second best Wrists. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77320/luminescent-bracers">
<img alt="Luminescent Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Luminescent Bracers</span></a> are bought from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> while also being Binds on Equip, meaning you can farm them from another character or buy on the Auction House. They are however much weaker than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71995/bracers-of-flowing-serenity">
<img alt="Bracers of Flowing Serenity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Flowing Serenity</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant:</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> if <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
