<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-balance-druid-dps">Hands for Balance Druid DPS</h4>For every armor slot that can hold tier pieces, there are no other items from Dragon Soul in that slot. This leaves us with having no choice but running tier in every slot, including running Restoration tier in one slot. In addition, unless you have heroic tier 12, then running LFR tier pieces is always your best option.<br/>
<br/>There will be situations where one of your slots for holding tier items can instead be a non-tier item or an "offpiece" as it is commonly called. For Hands, this would be if you have Balance tier in every slot except for Hands and your best tier piece for Hands is from the LFR difficulty. In such situations <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77160/fungus-born-gloves">
<img alt="Fungus-Born Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fungus-Born Gloves</span></a> is a tiny upgrade. However as it costs <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and provides a very small boost, it should only be bought if you have nothing else to spend <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on.<br/>
<br/>For Hands we want <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78676/deep-earth-gloves">
<img alt="Deep Earth Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_leather_raiddruid_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deep Earth Gloves</span></a>
<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a>, if engineer also use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a>
