<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-balance-druid-dps">Trinkets for Balance Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77995/will-of-unbinding">
<img alt="Will of Unbinding" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonetablet_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Will of Unbinding</span></a> is our best trinket in T13. It doesn't matter which version of it, even if it's LFR this is the trinket you want. <br/>
<br/>For the remaining trinket slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77991/insignia-of-the-corrupted-mind">
<img alt="Insignia of the Corrupted Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bijou_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insignia of the Corrupted Mind</span></a> is the best. The normal version is somewhat stronger than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69110/variable-pulse-lightning-capacitor">
<img alt="Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Variable Pulse Lightning Capacitor</span></a>, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78000/cunning-of-the-cruel">
<img alt="Cunning of the Cruel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cunning of the Cruel</span></a> slightly behind.<br/>
<br/>In addition, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77114/bottled-wishes">
<img alt="Bottled Wishes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bottled Wishes</span></a> has significant use for dealing damage to Tendons on the Spine of <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53879/deathwing">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathwing</span></a> encounter. First week one can also consider <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68998/rune-of-zeth">
<img alt="Rune of Zeth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_rune.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of Zeth</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Solar camping won't be too relevant in dragon soul, but our best trinkets for that is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77990/soulshifter-vortex">
<img alt="Soulshifter Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_cyclone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soulshifter Vortex</span></a> and either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65105/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
<img alt="Moonwell Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Chalice</span></a>. While combining with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65105/theralions-mirror">
<img alt="Theralion's Mirror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_teleportironforge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theralion's Mirror</span></a> have higher potential, it can be near impossible to resync for multiple uses in one fight, and even syncing them up the first time can be challenging.<div class="pad"></div>
