<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-balance-druid-dps">Weapons for Balance Druid DPS</h4>It shouldn't come as a surprise to anyone that <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71086/dragonwrath-tarecgosas-rest">
<img alt="Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/stave_2h_tarecgosa_e_01stagefinal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest</span></a> is massively ahead of any of the other options on this list. However if you do not have it, there are some options to consider. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78475/rathrak-the-poisonous-mind">
<img alt="Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rathrak, the Poisonous Mind</span></a> is our best weapon after <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71086/dragonwrath-tarecgosas-rest">
<img alt="Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/stave_2h_tarecgosa_e_01stagefinal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonwrath, Tarecgosa's Rest</span></a>. It is notably ahead of any other weapons, and also has an effect that adds some extra value on AoE. There's a decent gap to our next option which is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78363/vagaries-of-time">
<img alt="Vagaries of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vagaries of Time</span></a>, which is close to most of the following options like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78404/scalpel-of-unrelenting-agony">
<img alt="Scalpel of Unrelenting Agony" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scalpel of Unrelenting Agony</span></a> and even the healing mace <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78476/maw-of-the-dragonlord">
<img alt="Maw of the Dragonlord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maw of the Dragonlord</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78418/lightning-rod">
<img alt="Lightning Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Rod</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78451/visage-of-the-destroyer">
